5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to see you all. To ensure we don't overstretch our dear staff, I would like to look into the composition of the volunteer roster and the conservation lab staffing and backlog.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'll take a more pragmatic approach. I want to see the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I think we should focus on what actually draws a crowd. I'll look into the weekend head counts across ten seasons and the five years of visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I should check the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings in the gallery to ensure the space can handle the requirements.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to find out where the money goes! I'll look into the loan transport costs over three seasons and the mount-making charges and joiner's rate!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Does anyone else feel we should check the staffing, or are you all satisfied with your choices?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, your focus on personnel is noted, but I believe my choices address the more immediate risks of failure. I am satisfied with my selection.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,I agree with Shion that we need a balanced view. I'm quite happy with my choices since they'll tell us what the public actually wants to see.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I believe my choices are necessary for the safety of the building, so I will stick with them as well.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm super happy with mine too! I bet I'll find some big secrets about the budget!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It seems we are all in agreement then. I shall leave it at that and wait for the results.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
