31,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"My findings are quite concerning; the conservation lab is severely understaffed, and our volunteers are mostly from one specific group, which may limit our flexibility.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Shion,,"I've discovered that shipping cut-offs have caused delays in recent openings, and powered displays have a worrying history of frequent breakdowns during gallery hours.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,May,,"It turns out the public loves a bit of action! Head counts are higher for dynamic displays, and the comment slips show people really value having someone there to talk to.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The suspended bay has a strict weight limit that has caused issues with heavy crates, and our evening hire bookings mean we need displays that can be easily cleared or protected.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Wow! I found out that shipping and insurance for loans cost a huge chunk of the budget, and the cost for making mounts has gone way up!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"It seems we have a lot to consider. If the lab is so backed up, we must be very careful not to choose an exhibition that requires extensive cleaning or stabilization.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, I agree. Furthermore, we should avoid anything with complex powered elements or heavy reliance on distant lenders, given the maintenance and paperwork risks I've uncovered.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,May,,"But we can't forget the visitors! If we want a success, we need something dynamic and interactive, perhaps with a human element to keep the guests engaged.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, that sounds lovely, but we must be realistic. Anything we choose must be light enough for the suspended bay and not obstruct the gallery for our evening hires.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"And we can't forget the money! If loans are so expensive and mounts cost a fortune, maybe we should look for something that doesn't need a bunch of fancy new stands or pricey shipping!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I wonder if we can find a balance that respects our staff's time while still bringing joy to the visitors. Perhaps a local focus would help?,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, a local focus would certainly mitigate the shipping risks and paperwork delays I found. It is a logical way to ensure the exhibition actually opens on time.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,May,,"A local focus could work, provided it isn't just a room of static objects. We need that human connection the visitors are craving to make it a hit!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"If it is local, it might also be lighter and easier to manage around our evening bookings, which would be a relief for the building.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"That's a great idea! Local things would be way cheaper to move and probably wouldn't need those super expensive mounts, right?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I am glad we are all thinking along the same lines. Let us hope the candidates that are presented to us align with these practical needs.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Shion,,"Indeed. We have established a clear set of criteria: low maintenance, minimal shipping risk, and manageable weight. I expect we can now evaluate the candidates with a cold, logical eye.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,May,,"I'll be looking for that spark of excitement! As long as it's not boring, I'm on board with the practical side of things.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I will be looking for a proposal that respects the physical limits of our gallery and the schedule of our bookings.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'll be looking for the one that doesn't make the budget go ""poof""! I can't wait to see what the options are!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
