56,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Now that we have the candidates, let's see. A: Textiles of the Region, B: City Under Excavation, C: Light and Motion, and D: Maritime Trade Routes. I feel A is the most considerate of our staff.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, I agree. Candidate A avoids the shipping delays of D and the maintenance nightmares of C. It is the most reliable choice for a timely opening.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,May,,"A sounds a bit safe, but the demonstration sessions and interviews are exactly the kind of human interaction the visitors want! It's much more exciting than B or D.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Candidate A is also the safest for the building; textiles are light and won't stress the suspended bay like the reconstructions in B or the rigging in C.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,1,talk,Sakura,,And it's local! That means we won't spend all our money on shipping and insurance like we would for Candidate D. A is definitely the best for the budget!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Shizue,,It seems we have reached a rare and wonderful consensus so quickly. I feel very confident that Candidate A is the right choice for everyone involved.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, I concur. When the risks of C and D are weighed against the stability of A, the logical conclusion is undeniable. I see no reason to deviate.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,May,,I'm totally sold! It hits the sweet spot of being practical for the museum but still fun for the people visiting. I vote for A!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I agree. It satisfies all the structural and scheduling constraints I was worried about. I also vote for A.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"Me too! It's local, it's cheap, and it's super friendly! I vote for A!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I shall also cast my vote for Candidate A. It is a gentle and sustainable choice for our community and our staff.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Shion,,I vote for Candidate A. It is the only option that minimizes operational risk while meeting our basic requirements.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
